(cheery music plays)

00:00:13.942 --> 00:00:16.717
- The coins that Meowth had in Pokemon.

00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:18.169
- Wow, like, the one on his head.

00:00:18.169 --> 00:00:19.117
- The one on his head.

00:00:19.117 --> 00:00:20.093
- Rice puff?

00:00:20.383 --> 00:00:21.261
- Smells fried.

00:00:21.261 --> 00:00:23.421
- Oh, that's good, fried is good.

00:00:23.991 --> 00:00:25.068
(crunching)

00:00:27.918 --> 00:00:29.237
- I was not expecting that.

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:30.099
- I like that.

00:00:30.099 --> 00:00:31.985
- That's like sweet and
savory at the same time.

00:00:31.985 --> 00:00:33.522
- It's like a spicey rice cracker.

00:00:33.522 --> 00:00:35.200
- If you've ever had Pops cereal,

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.464
