00:00:36.464 --> 00:00:37.994
- Ya this kind of just seems like

00:00:37.994 --> 00:00:39.071
an airplane snack.

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:40.290
- Ya, like, their version of

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.578
the two pack of Ritz crackers.

00:00:41.578 --> 00:00:42.634
- Ya, ya, ya!

00:00:45.464 --> 00:00:46.531
- I've had these before,

00:00:46.531 --> 00:00:47.510
and I love 'em.

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.971
- I like the name, already.

00:00:48.971 --> 00:00:50.941
- You can eat the inner wrapper,

00:00:50.941 --> 00:00:52.371
