00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:07.965
- That's like, very chewy.

00:01:11.695 --> 00:01:13.265
- No, no.

00:01:13.265 --> 00:01:15.113
- Ooh, this looks like twigs.

00:01:15.113 --> 00:01:15.992
- Those are little fish.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:16.933
- What?

00:01:16.933 --> 00:01:18.098
- See that eye, lookin' at you.

00:01:18.718 --> 00:01:19.174
- Right?

00:01:19.174 --> 00:01:20.896
- That looks like sardines.

00:01:20.896 --> 00:01:21.742
Oh my God.

00:01:21.742 --> 00:01:22.521
- Basically fish.
- Holy shit.

00:01:22.876 --> 00:01:24.206
- Or it could be an eel.

00:01:27.106 --> 00:01:28.361
- That was damn good.

00:01:28.361 --> 00:01:28.751
- Mmm.

00:01:28.751 --> 00:01:29.566
- It's like salty.

00:01:29.566 --> 00:01:30.437
- Mmm!

00:01:30.897 --> 00:01:31.925
- Not bad at all.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:34.008
