00:01:50.149 --> 00:01:52.081
- He looks so happy
when you turn his head.

00:01:52.631 --> 00:01:54.990
- Also, a piggy bank.

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.050
- Could you just see,

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.394
