00:02:11.637 --> 00:02:13.267
(both slurp and laugh)

00:02:14.957 --> 00:02:15.807
(slurps)

00:02:16.937 --> 00:02:17.689
- Delicious.

00:02:17.689 --> 00:02:18.502
- Ya, they come to my desk

00:02:18.502 --> 00:02:20.390
