00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.786
- They're both jiggly.

00:02:31.086 --> 00:02:31.848
- Delicious.

00:02:31.848 --> 00:02:32.433
- Ya!

00:02:32.433 --> 00:02:33.559
- I actually liked everything.

00:02:33.559 --> 00:02:36.359
- The crackers, were a dark horse,

00:02:36.359 --> 00:02:37.974
I really enjoyed them.

00:02:37.974 --> 00:02:40.727
- Very understated, but very delicious.

00:02:40.727 --> 00:02:42.186
- There were some weird
combinations going on.

00:02:42.266 --> 00:02:42.839
- Ya.

00:02:42.839 --> 00:02:44.323
- Fish and almonds.

00:02:45.453 --> 00:02:46.994
- On sight, I was like, no.

00:02:46.994 --> 00:02:48.554
But taste, yes.

00:02:48.554 --> 00:02:50.004
- I feel like it's gotta be a really

00:02:50.004 --> 00:02:51.363
fun place to eat.

00:02:51.363 --> 00:02:51.901
- Ya!

00:02:51.901 --> 00:02:53.286
- 'Cause like, there's some crazy,

00:02:53.286 --> 00:02:54.959
